</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/af652be4-7c4d-11f1-b273-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/DSC-5620-67d6280df0.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/af652be4-7c4d-11f1-b273-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/DSC-5620-67d6280df0.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">05f79190-7c4e-11f1-99c4-25cf7d22934c</guid><pubDate>Fri, 10 Jul 2026 11:03:24 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/af652be4-7c4d-11f1-b273-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/DSC-5620-67d6280df0.jpg">© 图片取自Harmay官网</source><dc:creator>夏榕</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>中国将公布第二季度增长数据，专家预测增幅仅为4.5%</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260710-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%B0%86%E5%85%AC%E5%B8%83%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%AD%A3%E5%BA%A6%E5%A2%9E%E9%95%BF%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%E5%A2%9E%E5%B9%85%E4%BB%85%E4%B8%BA4-5</link><description>
